  npcName: Gate Goblin
  dialogueLines:
  - Hi, whaddup.
  - I'll let you through if you collect me 20 coins.
  - Cool, get to it. Be wary of the other goblins, they aren't as friendly as I.
  - No gold, no exit.
  - You still looking? There should be enough around the sewers somewhere.
  - Thanks for the gold, go on through.
